<title>USA: Sherwin-Williams Sept Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Sherwin-Williams Sept Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.02		    $0.87</p>
<p> Net			 88,550		   74,948</p>
<p> Sales		  1,171,010		  911,387</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  86,473		   85,758</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.20		    $1.95</p>
<p> Net			190,045		  166,888</p>
<p> Sales		  3,174,035		2,532,912</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  86,359		   85,706</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Sherwin-Williams Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said third quarter and nine months ended Sept 30, 1996 included results of Pratt &amp; Lambert United Inc, acquired in January 1996, and other smaller acquisitions made since the third quarter 1995.</p>
